    {
      "id": "pickCategory",
      "type": "uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "Pick the category",
        "icon": "users"
      },
      "model": {
        "type": "bpmn:UserTask",
        "serviceType": "Actions.HITL"
      },
      "outputs": {
        "output": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Task result data",
          "source": {
            "type": "literal",
            "expression": "=result",
            "fieldType": "string"
          },
          "var": "output",
          "properties": {
            "Action": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "billing",
                "technical",
                "account"
              ],
              "default": "billing"
            }
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Task completion status",
          "source": {
            "type": "literal",
            "expression": "=result.Action",
            "fieldType": "string"
          },
          "var": "status",
          "enum": [
            "billing",
            "technical",
            "account"
          ],
          "default": "billing"
        }
      },
      "inputs": {
        "title": "Pick the category",
        "priority": "Low",
        "recipient": {
          "channels": [
            "Email",
            "ActionCenter"
          ],
          "connections": {},
          "assignee": {
            "type": "group"
          }
        },
        "schema": {
          "schemaId": "33950bb3-9e59-5591-86fc-19156f630f8a",
          "fields": [
            {
              "id": "category",
              "label": "Agent category",
              "type": "string",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.classifyItem.output.category"
            },
            {
              "id": "reason",
              "label": "Agent reason",
              "type": "string",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.classifyItem.output.reason"
            }
          ],
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "id": "billing",
              "name": "billing",
              "type": "string",
              "isPrimary": true,
              "action": "Continue"
            },
            {
              "id": "technical",
              "name": "technical",
              "type": "string",
              "isPrimary": false,
              "action": "Continue"
            },
            {
              "id": "account",
              "name": "account",
              "type": "string",
              "isPrimary": false,
              "action": "Continue"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stickyNote_1",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0.0",
      "display": {},
      "inputs": {
        "color": "yellow",
        "content": "**Routing and triage: agent**\n\nAn agent classifies each incoming item and the switch routes it down the matching path. Items below the confidence floor go to a person, whose choice rejoins the same routes.\n\n- Configure **Classify item**: prompt, model, and input. Reference the variable that holds the item in the prompt. Then edit the switch cases and the form outcomes to match your categories.\n- Replace each **Handle** step with that route's downstream. Each should read the item and the agent's category (`vars.classifyItem.output.category`).\n- Tune the confidence floor (0.7 by default).\n- Simulated outputs use sample support tickets and run in debug only. Replace the placeholders before publishing."
      }
    }
  ],
